\newcommand{\gnn}{graph neural network (GNN)}
\begin{document}
\section{Introduction}
\gnn{} models have become the default for molecular property prediction.
\section{Method}
Our \gnn{} encoder uses four message-passing layers. Compared with a plain \gnn{}, the gated variant converges faster.
\section{Results}
The \gnn{} baseline reaches 0.81 AUC, while our \gnn{} variant reaches 0.87.
